T*
(Syrka is not an LMS, portfolio site, LinkedIn clone, job board, or course marketplace. Syrka is ) Tj
T*
(an AI-powered Human Capability Platform. Its product experience must constantly reinforce one ) Tj
T*
(question:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(> What can I become, and what evidence supports that journey?) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(UX is separated from implementation because the interface must express Syrka's ontology and ) Tj
T*
(reasoning model regardless of frontend framework, backend service, LMS provider, AI model, or ) Tj
T*
(database. Next.js routes, Supabase tables, graph queries, and Open edX adapters may evolve; the ) Tj
T*
(product experience architecture remains stable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
