() Tj
T*
(UX-001 establishes Syrka's product experience architecture. Every future Figma design, Google ) Tj
T*
(Stitch prototype, Claude implementation, frontend route, dashboard, and product workflow must ) Tj
T*
(reinforce Syrka as an AI-powered Human Capability Platform.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The interface must keep the MVP focused while allowing long-term expansion. Every screen must ) Tj
T*
(reflect ontology, every capability must be evidence-backed, every recommendation must be ) Tj
T*
(explainable, and every role must navigate complexity through calm, trusted, purposeful product ) Tj
T*
(structure rather than conventional LMS clutter.) Tj
